digraph SearchTree {
  label="8-Puzzle search tree (BFS) / Partial search tree: 20 of 54 nodes drawn (all nodes up to depth 2 plus the whole solution path and its alternatives). / Dashed boxes stand for branches that exist in the tree but are not drawn. / BFS search: 54 nodes generated, 20 expanded, goal at depth 5."; labelloc=t; rankdir=TB;
